# installer.ps1 template for a single agent. [Phase 1/4]
#
# The main harness fills the placeholders below with values generated by code
# (ca.py / enroll.py) -- never by a model. This is an individual, single-use
# installer: the enrollment token works exactly once.
#
# Placeholders (filled by the main harness):
#   {{MAIN_ADDRESS}}       wss host:port of the main harness
#   {{CA_CERT_PEM}}        the CA certificate, for pinning
#   {{ENROLLMENT_TOKEN}}   one-time token
#   {{AGENT_NAME}}         human-readable agent name
#
# Flow (see AGENT_MODULE_SPEC.md section 4.2):
#   ensure Python -> create a small venv -> fetch the thin wrapper + minimal deps
#   over the CA-pinned channel -> enroll (present token, send CSR, receive cert)
#   -> start the wrapper, which reconnects later with the client certificate.
#
# Not implemented yet.
